  "body": "This property must be sold. The vendor is motivated and ready to meet the market, presenting an outstanding opportunity to secure a substantial family home in a premium St Heliers position. All offers are encouraged.\r\n\r\nWelcome to your premium family home in the heart of St Heliers - a stunning five-bedroom freehold concrete home offering effortless luxury, superb entertaining and exceptional family flexibility.  \r\nSet on an elevated site with sweeping views to the north, west, and south, this home is designed to make every day feel like a holiday. The master suite is a true retreat, opening directly onto the top deck for tranquil mornings or evenings under the stars. Multiple living and dining spaces create a seamless connection between indoors and out, perfect for hosting family and friends.\r\nEnjoy summer by the pool, complete with its own bathroom and shower for guests. A spacious home office makes working from home a pleasure, while the dedicated movie room is ideal for teenagers or relaxed evenings in.\r\n\r\nConstructed primarily of concrete for lasting peace of mind, this is a home that feels as solid as it looks. Nestled on a quiet, no-exit street just minutes from St Heliers village, the beach and an easy drive to the airport - this address truly has it all.\r\nZoned for St Heliers School and Glendowie College, a superb choice for families. Contact Murray or Sarah for a viewing and more details.",
